<title>USA: CalEnergy acquisition move advances.</title>
<headline>CalEnergy acquisition move advances.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalEnergy Co Inc said Thursday its ownership level reached 26.75 percent in connection with its proposed acquisition of  Northern Electric plc.</p>
<p>Northern Electric is a regional electricity distribution and supply company in the United Kingdom in which CE Electric UK plc has purchased an additional 13.6 million shares. CE Electric is 70 percent owned by CalEnergy and 30 percent by Peter Kiewit Sons Inc.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
